## 5. TAGGING & VERSIONING (Semantic Versioning)

```
MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH  →  1.2.3

MAJOR: Breaking change (API incompatible)
MINOR: New feature (backward compatible)
PATCH: Bug fix (backward compatible)

Ví dụ:
v1.0.0   ← Initial release
v1.1.0   ← Thêm tính năng Budget Transfer
v1.1.1   ← Fix bug token revocation
v1.2.0   ← Thêm tính năng Google OAuth
v2.0.0   ← Redesign API (breaking change)
```

```bash
# ✅ Tạo tag chuẩn
git tag -a v1.2.0 -m "Release v1.2.0: Add Google OAuth, Budget Transfer"
git push origin v1.2.0

# ✅ Xem tags
git tag -l "v*" --sort=-v:refname | head -10
```

